    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in the future to a world on the brink of extinction. Discover the source of the radiation and save civilization from a mysterious threat. Craterlands is a retro inspired 2D sandbox game with a gigantic world to explore, robust town building mechanics and a wide variety of items to craft!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A gigantic world to explore, new regions open as you advance the story and you can even travel to different planets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night cycle. Different enemies may come out at night and even the seasons change in some regions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG Leveling System - Level up as you explore, fight mutants and complete quests. Tailor your build by spending skill points and specialize in melee, ranged, energy or minions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 Person Multiplayer - Have your friends join to build, explore and fight a variety of epic bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricate Electrical Systems. Wire up lights, machines and other gadgets. Control lighting and electrical signals through network controls.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/0a6ab20f04300d1eb47be0a3f8453003.poster.avif?t=1755289978\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/0a6ab20f04300d1eb47be0a3f8453003.webm?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/0a6ab20f04300d1eb47be0a3f8453003.mp4?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation - Link machines together with tubes and conveyer belts to create advanced recipes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/fe8c870b885ae37c279df870784b4785.poster.avif?t=1755289978\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/fe8c870b885ae37c279df870784b4785.webm?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/fe8c870b885ae37c279df870784b4785.mp4?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NPC Classes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rescue NPCs and add them to your towns. Add buildings and assign them roles such as Blacksmith, Hospital, Forester and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/d3bb290fd46967c2ed4aff4a42f12514.poster.avif?t=1755289978\" width=200 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/d3bb290fd46967c2ed4aff4a42f12514.webm?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/d3bb290fd46967c2ed4aff4a42f12514.mp4?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover alien races and build unique settlements on other planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/26c84cde2bb9404f82c89532ce893f99.poster.avif?t=1755289978\" width=200 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/26c84cde2bb9404f82c89532ce893f99.webm?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/26c84cde2bb9404f82c89532ce893f99.mp4?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in the future to a world on the brink of extinction. Discover the source of the radiation and save civilization from a mysterious threat. Craterlands is a retro inspired 2D sandbox game with a gigantic world to explore, robust town building mechanics and a wide variety of items to craft!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A gigantic world to explore, new regions open as you advance the story and you can even travel to different planets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night cycle. Different enemies may come out at night and even the seasons change in some regions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG Leveling System - Level up as you explore, fight mutants and complete quests. Tailor your build by spending skill points and specialize in melee, ranged, energy or minions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 Person Multiplayer - Have your friends join to build, explore and fight a variety of epic bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricate Electrical Systems. Wire up lights, machines and other gadgets. Control lighting and electrical signals through network controls.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/0a6ab20f04300d1eb47be0a3f8453003.poster.avif?t=1755289978\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/0a6ab20f04300d1eb47be0a3f8453003.webm?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/0a6ab20f04300d1eb47be0a3f8453003.mp4?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation - Link machines together with tubes and conveyer belts to create advanced recipes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/fe8c870b885ae37c279df870784b4785.poster.avif?t=1755289978\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/fe8c870b885ae37c279df870784b4785.webm?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/fe8c870b885ae37c279df870784b4785.mp4?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NPC Classes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rescue NPCs and add them to your towns. Add buildings and assign them roles such as Blacksmith, Hospital, Forester and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/d3bb290fd46967c2ed4aff4a42f12514.poster.avif?t=1755289978\" width=200 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/d3bb290fd46967c2ed4aff4a42f12514.webm?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/d3bb290fd46967c2ed4aff4a42f12514.mp4?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover alien races and build unique settlements on other planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/26c84cde2bb9404f82c89532ce893f99.poster.avif?t=1755289978\" width=200 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/26c84cde2bb9404f82c89532ce893f99.webm?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/26c84cde2bb9404f82c89532ce893f99.mp4?t=1755289978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
